{title: I Surrender All}
{artist: Judson W. Van DeVenter / Winfield S. Weeden}
{genre: Gospel}
{flow: Response}
{style: Traditional}
{key: D}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]All to Jesus I sur[G]render
[D]All to Him I freely [A7]give
I will [D]ever love and [G]trust Him
In His [D]presence [A7]daily [D]live
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
I sur[D]render all, I sur[G]render all
[D]All to Thee, my blessed [A7]Saviour
I sur[D]render [A7]all[D]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]All to Jesus I sur[G]render
[D]Humbly at His feet I [A7]bow
[D]Worldly pleasures [G]all forsaken
Take me, [D]Jesus, [A7]take me [D]now
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]All to Jesus I sur[G]render
[D]Make me, Saviour, wholly [A7]Thine
Let me [D]feel the Holy [G]Spirit
Truly [D]know that [A7]Thou art [D]mine
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[D]All to Jesus I sur[G]render
[D]Lord, I give myself to [A7]Thee
Fill me [D]with Thy love and [G]power
Let Thy [D]blessing [A7]fall on [D]me
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
